flowchart TD
  I[Token IDs B × T] --> E[Learned token embedding 513 × 384]
  E --> X[Block input x]
  subgraph Block[Pre-norm Transformer block × 8]
    X --> NormAttention[RMSNorm eps 1e-8]
    NormAttention --> QKV[Bias-free Q K V projections; 6 heads × 64]
    QKV --> R[RoPE on Q and K; V unchanged]
    R --> A[Causal scaled dot-product attention; output projection]
    A --> S1[Residual add x + attention]
    X --> S1
    S1 --> N2[RMSNorm eps 1e-8]
    N2 --> F[Biased linear 384→1536; ReLU; linear 1536→384]
    F --> S2[Residual add]
    S1 --> S2
  end
  S2 --> N3[Final RMSNorm]
  N3 --> H[Untied bias-free LM head 384→513]
  H --> L[Logits B × T × 513]
  L --> C[Next-token cross entropy]
